\par\par \b \uc2 Thai c.bank says to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in Thai baht periodically\b0\par\par\uc2 79 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 April 2011\par 04:35\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, April 26 (Reuters) - The \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  periodically in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to limit volatility over the short term, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Prasarn Trairatvorakul said on Tuesday, following gains in the baht against the dollar this year.\par \par \uc2  But the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not stop the baht's broader trend, he told a seminar. \par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Kitiphong Thaicharoen. Editing by Jason Szep)\par \par \uc2 THAILAND-BAHT/ (URGENT)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110426e74q0002x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
