\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE:Thai  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Consistently  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Market\b0\par\par\uc2 294 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 November 2009\par 07:34\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds minister's comments about meeting with \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly to discuss exchange rate situation, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor's comment on baht)\par \par \uc2 BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--Finance Minister Korn Chatikavanij said Friday that the \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  has consistently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in the past several months to ensure that the baht's pace of appreciation is gradual.\par \par \uc2 He told reporters that he was satisfied with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  management in the current environment, adding that it is worthwhile to engage in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's competitiveness.\par \par \uc2 As \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  comes at a cost, it is crucial to weigh the action's worthiness and its effectiveness in shoring up the country's competitiveness, Korn said.\par \par \uc2 In order to prevent an excessive rise in baht money supply, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has to sterilize the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by issuing massive amounts of bonds to mop up extra liquidity caused by its action in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 "When it comes to the point that the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't worth doing so anymore then we will try and figure out some other things," he said.\par \par \uc2 Korn said he meets with the \uc2 Bank of Thailand\uc2  at least once a week to discuss the exchange rate situation.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's governor, Tarisa Watanagase, said Friday that the baht has appreciated around 4% against the dollar so far this year, a pace that is around the midpoint of those of regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Last week, Korn told Dow Jones Newswires that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought $15 billion so far this year to curb the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise.\par \par \uc2 -By Bangkok Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; 662-266-0744; djnews.bangkok@dowjones.com [ 20-11-09 0634GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020091120e5bk000do\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
