\par\par \b \uc2 EM ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Rupiah outperforms, baht again contained by c.bank\b0\par\par\uc2 873 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Oktober 2009\par 08:44\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  * Rupiah leads Asia \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  higher as dollar falters globally\par \par \uc2  * Baht edges up but capped by suspected c.bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  * ING expects China to increase yuan flexibility\par \par \uc2  By Kevin Yao\par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, Oct 14 (Reuters) - The high-yielding Indonesian rupiah outperformed its peers on Wednesday as the U.S. dollar lost ground globally, but the Thai baht's strength was tempered by suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2  The dollar slid to its weakest level in 14 months against a basket of major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  <.DXY>, under pressure from expectations of continued low U.S interest rates and investor bets on higher yielding and commodity \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . [ID:nT318806]\par \par \uc2  Central banks in Asia have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in recent weeks to slow the rise of their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the beleaguered dollar amid concerns about losing export competitiveness.\par \par \uc2  But Sean Callow, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at \uc2 Westpac\uc2 , said there was scope for most Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to rise against the dollar despite recent rallies.\par \par \uc2  "Not all dollar/Asia pairs are the same but overall, if you are running large trade surpluses, attracting strong portfolio and FDI inflows and U.S. dollar yields very little, it's highly likely that your \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will rise," he said.\par \par \uc2  He expects China to allow the yuan, which has been virtually pegged to the dollar since mid-2008, to rise again next year.\par \par \uc2  BAHT\par \par \uc2  The \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  was suspected of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  as Thai baht <THB=TH> edged up to 33.25 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 "But I'm not sure how aggressive they are because sentiment on the dollar is still the same," said a trader in Bangkok.\par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been buying dollars in recent weeks to curb the baht's strength to help exporters compete, analysts say.\par \par \uc2  "They have been buying dollar since the baht rose past 34," said another trader in Singapore. The baht broke the 34 level in early September.\par \par \uc2  RUPIAH\par \par \uc2  The rupiah <IDR=> gained 0.8 percent to 9,370 against a broadly weaker dollar, extending its gains so far this year to 17 percent -- the best performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Asia.\par \par \uc2  The rupiah was "still within fundamental range" despite its recent gains, said acting \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Darmin Nasution. [ID:nJAK544675]\par \par \uc2  "The rupiah is following other regionals and majors," said a Jakarta-based trader, who cautioned that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if rupiah hits 9,350.\par \par \uc2  "The recent underpinners for rupiah are the inflows to the stock market and yields-seeking assets," said Enrico Tanuwidjaja, strategist at \uc2 OCBC Bank\uc2 .\par \par \uc2  "The NDFs points have moved substantially lower in very recent times, so it is quite likely the rupiah may face consolidation ahead."\par \par \uc2  The rupiah has rallied 3 percent in the past two weeks, pushing down the spread between three-month NDFs <IDR3MNDFOR=> and spot rate to 37 points from 130.\par \par \uc2  Foreigners bought a net 4.65 trillion rupiah ($490 million) of rupiah-denominated government bonds last week, according to government data. But they sold a net 111 million in Indonesian stocks last week, according to Nomura.\par \par \uc2  YUAN\par \par \uc2  The Chinese yuan <CNY=CFXS> hovered near 6.8256 per dollar, little changed from Tuesday's close.\par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, twelve-month yuan appreciation implied by offshore dollar/yuan NDFs <CNY1YNDFOR=> rose to a nearly 14-month high of 2.66 percent, as Chinese data showed the pace of decline in  exports slowed in September. [ID:nPEK367690]\par \par \uc2  Many analysts expect China to let the yuan resume its steady appreciation early next year, when exports were expected to start rising again.\par \par \uc2  Analysts at ING reiterated their recent forecast on Wednesday in a note that the Chinese authorities will move to allow greater exchange rate flexibility by widening the yuan's daily trade band against the dollar to 3 percent.\par \par \uc2  Currently, the yuan is allowed to move 0.5 percent on either side of the mid-point of the band, set by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2  VS U.S. DOLLAR  Change on the day at 0624 GMT \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid   Previous day    Pct Move\par  Japan yen        89.04          89.70       +0.74\par  Sing dlr        1.3916         1.3945       +0.21\par  Taiwan dlr      32.230         32.302       +0.22\par  Korean won     1162.26        1168.80       +0.56\par  Baht             33.26          33.28       +0.06\par  Peso             46.45          46.48       +0.05\par  Rupiah         9360.00        9445.00       +0.91\par  Rupee            46.15          46.41       +0.56\par  Ringgit         3.3680         3.3890       +0.62\par  Yuan            6.8256         6.8265       +0.01\par  Change so far in 20