\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Thai cenbank governor sees pressure easing on baht\b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Oktober 2009\par 18:15\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Baht not up much compared with trading partner \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 * Upward pressure to ease as stimulus boosts imports\par \par \uc2 ZURICH, Oct 9 (Reuters) - Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Tarisa Watanagase said the Thai baht <THB=> had only marginally appreciated when compared against a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of important trading partners, she told a Swiss newspaper.\par \par \uc2 In an advance copy of an interview with the Finanz und Wirtschaft newspaper due out on Saturday, Watanagase said: "The exporters should not only look at the dollar but at a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  weighted to our most important trading partners."\par \par \uc2 "From this perspective, the baht has only marginally appreciated. Short-term exchange rate fluctuations are generally given a too large importance."\par \par \uc2 Watanagase said she expected a Thai government stimulus programme to boost imports soon, which should push the balance of payments surplus into deficit which should mean the appreciation pressure on the baht would subside.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOT) has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly through offshore bank agents to curb baht gains this year, largely by committing to buy dollars through forward \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps.\par \par \uc2 On Thursday, assistant Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Suchada Kirakul said the baht was rising too fast this month and the \uc2 Bank of Thailand\uc2  continues to act to slow the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise.\par \par \uc2 Watanagase said exchange rates could only be kept within ranges that were good for the economy with broad international cooperation. (Reporting by Emma Thomasson; Editing by Ron Askew)\par \par \uc2 THAILAND/BAHT (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|ABX|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020091009e5a9001f4\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Thailand near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clve